## 1. Summary

App: Blue Basket: A community garden tracker where neighbours share plots and tools. Audience: Everyone uses the app the same way (one kind of user). 26 screens in 12 journeys. Journeys: Browse and open an item, Sign in, Search for an item, Send a form and follow it, Review submissions, Edit an item. Roles: User, Staff, Admin. Look: Clean and.

- Who uses it: Everyone uses the app the same way (one kind of user).
- It has 26 screens in 12 journeys: Browse and open an item, Sign in, Search for an item, Send a form and follow it, Review submissions, Edit an item and 6 more.
- The look is clean and bright with a bottom-tabs navigation.
- Mocked for now: Sign-in codes, File storage, Maps and geocoding, Send codes and reminders from the server.
- Assumed instead of asked: Light or dark, Where the data comes from, Offline, Notifications, Usage analytics, Language and 5 more.
- Added from research: Forms to collect information, Photo gallery, Map view, Bottom tab navigation, Short onboarding, Empty, loading and error states and 1 more.

## 2. App

```yaml id=APP kind=app
name: Blue Basket
purpose: A community garden tracker where neighbours share plots and tools
audience: Everyone uses the app the same way (one kind of user).
```

