## 12. Build sequence

```yaml id=BUILD kind=build_sequence
steps:
  - id: S0
    name: Scaffold from the stack template
    load: [APP, DESIGN]
    gate: boots_on_web_preview
  - id: S1
    name: Theme and tokens
    load: [DESIGN]
    gate: token_file_validates
  - id: S2
    name: Component kit variants
    load: [DESIGN]
    gate: kit_renders_in_all_variants
  - id: S3
    name: Navigation shell and auth gate
    load: [NAV, ROLES]
    gate: all_routes_resolve
  - id: S4
    name: 'Data layer: types, API client, mock server'
    load: [DATA, API]
    gate: typecheck_passes
  - id: S5
    name: 'Vertical slice: the primary flow end to end'
    load: [FLW-001]
    gate: user_feedback
    flow: FLW-001
    screens: [SCR-004, SCR-005, SCR-006, SCR-007]
    stop_for_feedback: true
  - id: S6
    name: Screen groups in parallel
    gate: screens_render_in_all_states_and_checks_pass
    parallel:
      - group: sign-in
        screens: [SCR-001, SCR-002]
        owns: [app/login.tsx, app/welcome.tsx]
      - group: customer
        screens: [SCR-003]
        owns: [app/signup.tsx, app/signup/**]
      - group: edit-an-item
        screens: [SCR-008]
        owns: [app/items/edit.tsx, app/items/edit/**]
      - group: add-a-photo
        screens: [SCR-009, SCR-011]
        owns: [app/gallery.tsx, app/gallery/new.tsx]
      - group: view-a-photo
        screens: [SCR-010]
        owns: ['app/gallery/[id].tsx', 'app/gallery/[id]/**']
      - group: explore-places
        screens: [SCR-012, SCR-013]
        owns: [app/map.tsx, app/map/**]
      - group: search-for-an-item
        screens: [SCR-014, SCR-015]
        owns: [app/search.tsx, app/search/**]
      - group: send-a-form-and-follow-it
        screens: [SCR-016, SCR-017, SCR-018, SCR-019]
        owns: [app/forms.tsx, app/forms/**]
      - group: review-submissions
        screens: [SCR-020]
        owns: [app/admin/forms.tsx, app/admin/forms/**]
      - group: change-my-details
        screens: [SCR-021, SCR-022]
        owns: [app/account.tsx, app/account/**]
      - group: find-help-and-legal-pages
        screens: [SCR-023, SCR-024, SCR-025]
        owns: [app/help.tsx, app/legal.tsx, app/settings.tsx]
      - group: delete-my-account
        screens: [SCR-026]
        owns: [app/settings/delete-account.tsx, app/settings/delete-account/**]
  - id: S7
    name: 'Global behavior wiring: offline, locale, notifications, analytics, deep links'
    load: [BEHAVIOR]
    gate: flow_tests_pass
  - id: S8
    name: 'Integrations: mocks and adapters'
    load: [INTEGRATIONS]
    gate: adapters_typecheck
  - id: S9
    name: Polish and accessibility
    load: [DESIGN, BEHAVIOR]
    gate: lint_and_accessibility_checks_pass
  - id: S10
    name: Hand off to QA
    load: [ACCEPT]
    gate: release_gate
```

## 13. Acceptance

```yaml id=ACCEPT kind=acceptance
checks:
  - The app starts in the web preview without errors
  - Every screen can be reached from the navigation or from another screen
  - Every list screen shows loading, empty and error states
  - No screen shows a raw error code or a stack trace
  - Every action opens a screen or calls an operation
  - Text stays readable at the largest system font size
  - Signed-in screens ask a signed-out person to sign in first
  - The main journey (Browse and open an item) can be completed from start to end
  - Every integration works in mock mode with no keys
  - 'Personal data is never written to logs (data classification: internal)'
```

## 14. Assumptions and sources

```yaml id=ASSUME kind=assumptions
assumptions:
  - slot_id: design.mode
    label: Light or dark
    value_text: system
    impact: Sets whether the app follows the phone setting or stays light or dark.
  - slot_id: data.source
    label: Where the data comes from
    value_text: generated
    impact: Decides how the sample data and the mock backend are described.
  - slot_id: behavior.offline
    label: Offline
    value_text: basic
    impact: Decides what works without a connection.
  - slot_id: behavior.notifications
    label: Notifications
    value_text: 'yes'
    impact: Decides whether notification kinds are listed in the behavior section.
  - slot_id: behavior.analytics
    label: Usage analytics
    value_text: 'no'
    impact: Decides whether analytics events are listed.
  - slot_id: locale
    label: Language
    value_text: en
    impact: Sets the language of the app text.
  - slot_id: a11y
    label: Accessibility
    value_text: standard
    impact: Decides how strict the accessibility checks are.
  - slot_id: auth.sso
    label: Company sign-in
    value_text: not_needed
    impact: Decides whether sign-in uses the company account.
  - slot_id: data.classification
    label: Data classification
    value_text: internal
    impact: Adds data handling rules to the file.
  - slot_id: release.channel
    label: Release channel
    value_text: internal
    impact: Decides who receives the first builds.
  - slot_id: approvers
    label: Approvers
    value_text: requester
    impact: Decides who must approve the plan.
  - label: 'Company rule: data classification'
    value_text: internal
    impact: Data is treated as internal; personal data is never written to logs.
  - label: 'Role added: Staff'
    value_text: Staff
    impact: A feature you chose needs this role, so it stays even though it was not picked.
  - label: 'Role added: Admin'
    value_text: Admin
    impact: A feature you chose needs this role, so it stays even though it was not picked.
research_additions:
  - id: RA-001
